  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRANT TO LUXDEV - re-coding</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x201c;Comprehensive protection for migrants and refugees, with emphasis on children, women and LGBTIQ+ populations in the process of integration in Coahuila&#x201d; project in Mexico, implemented by Frontera con Justicia &#x2013; Casa del Migrante de Saltillo, aims to provide comprehensive protection to people in situations of human mobility&#x2014;particularly migrant and refugee children, women and LGBTIQ+ population&#x2014;who are in the process of seeking asylum, integrating locally or in transit through Coahuila. Casa del Migrante de Saltillo will support this population through legal, psychosocial and humanitarian interventions that prioritise the prevention of violence, assistance to survivors and the active promotion of their rights.</narrative>
  </description>
